  "coverage_limit": "toml 1.2.1 has no parser of its own below the event level: toml::from_str lexes and parses through toml_parser 1.1.5 (Source::lex, parse_document events) and toml builds DeTable/DeValue and the toml::Table/Value tree from those events. toml_edit 0.25.19 drives the same toml_parser crate, so the two paths share the toml_parser family. Datetime values are toml_datetime 1.1.3 structs (date, time, offset parts); the harness converts offset date-times to the UTC instant arithmetically. Feature defaults: preserve_order is off, so tables are BTreeMap-backed."
